[indent]•  [color=#000000]刘备[/color]：直属上级，战略部署者[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]张飞、马超[/color]：下辩战役的同僚，各领一路军[/indent]
